$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The battle between the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> rages on. This time they battle at a docking station on Planet Avicord.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base to capture it for a point.  There is also a center control tower that will prove to be crucial in the battle; the team that holds this fortification gains a valuable tactical advantage over the other as well as one point.  The first team to reach 6 points shall be the victor!(Note: Different generators power different things)" @
	   "\n\n<f1>Created By:<f0> Todd Simpson/RedNight" @
	   "\n<f1>Special Thanks To:<f0> SG_Avenger (http://www.avenger.net/)";